    "media:imagetext": "PAMAM\nFASHION SPLASH\nIN THE TROPICS\nNonstop out of New York's freezing headwinds and into the soft, heady\nair of Puerto Rico: time, five and a quarter hours; dress, as dramatic as\nthe change in temperature. The hot red flannel blazer is lightweight\nwool and cotton, a standout with white flannels, mesh shirt and\nshoes. On the sennit straw, snap brim is new for this winter's getaway\nBLAKEN, SLAURS AND HAT TRON SARS FIFTH AVENUE, NEW YORK, N.T.\n67",
